        "Observed on 2026-10-12 in specialists/production: expert-agents-mcp 0.1.0 accepts authenticated server/discover with MCP 2026-07-28 per-request metadata and headers, while legacy initialize is rejected with -32022; no expert was invoked.",
        "Declared by the specialists/production tools/list response on 2026-10-12: expert_engineering, expert_research and expert_logistics accept question plus optional context and may return EXPERT_AGENT_DISPATCHED with dispatchId for expert_collect; this is catalog metadata, not observed tool execution.",
